  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Novas Vidas: Promoting Sustainable Integration of Vulnerable Young Migrants in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support vulnerable young migrants across the state S&#xE3;o Paulo, promoting income generation opportunities, aiming at economic self-sufficiency, and reducing their vulnerabilities, supporting them in a trajectory towards long-term integration, prosperity, and resilience. This will be achieved through the provision of learning and career support and capacity building to young migrants in target communities, strengthened partnerships and engagement with the private sector and other local stakeholders, and community engagement with the provision of life-saving information and orientation on rights, services, and protection themes.</narrative>
  </description>
